sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Pesquisador
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant R as routes
    participant UC as usecases
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant W as workers DrugHunter
    participant FS as resultados/

    rect rgb(240,246,255)
    Note over U,FS: ADMET (requer item ChEMBL com status done)
    U->>FE: Rodar ADMET
    FE->>R: POST /api/admet/run
    R->>UC: uc_iniciar_admet
    UC->>DB: cria ou substitui admet_results (running)
    UC->>W: thread → _dh_admet_worker
    W->>W: MoleculeEvaluator (TPSA, WLOGP, PAINS, BBB, HIA, PGP)
    W->>FS: ADMET/*.csv e gráfico BOILED-Egg
    W-->>UC: contagens (bbb_plus, hia_plus, tóxicas...)
    UC->>DB: done + contagens
    FE->>R: GET /results/{id} e /molecules
    end

    rect rgb(255,248,235)
    Note over U,FS: Clustering (requer ADMET done)
    U->>FE: Escolhe fingerprint e max_mols
    FE->>R: POST /api/clustering/iniciar
    R->>UC: uc_iniciar_clustering
    UC->>DB: cria job (running) e apaga NeuroDock dependente
    UC->>W: thread → _dh_clustering_worker
    W->>W: fingerprints (Morgan, MACCS ou Farmacóforo)
    W->>W: perform_clustering (PCA + KMeans + silhouette)
    W->>W: gera tsne_data.json
    W->>FS: centroides MCS, kmeans.txt, plots
    UC->>FS: move resultado para alvo_job_id
    UC->>DB: done, n_clusters, silhouette
    FE->>R: GET /tsne-data, /centroid/{n}, /download
    end
